{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >King Aldric's Paladin Guard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/4e9d6a79d4c3f54702debd78ef60cc80.avif?t=1757014864\" width=630 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the king's new tactician. Organize and deploy the paladin guard to protect important shipments headed north through a dangerous new landscape. In the demo, take control of Roland and his squire Oliver in combat. Equip them and power them up to meet the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Protect Your Convoy on the Perilous Journey North</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/c232765e7904f3851057ff5189b97405.avif?t=1757014864\" width=630 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three available convoys to choose in the demo, each with their own abilities, advantages, and disadvantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Route</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/3a1244c98f55613ecceb9fc50d017190.poster.avif?t=1757014864\" width=520 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/3a1244c98f55613ecceb9fc50d017190.webm?t=1757014864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/3a1244c98f55613ecceb9fc50d017190.mp4?t=1757014864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the world map and decide which branching paths to take. Some may be more challenging and rewarding than others. Some may lead you to new surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes the first stages within the city walls. Depending on the path you take there are 7 stages with 5 miniboss experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Treasure and Merchants Along the Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/b3fc7513f50eff762a6d50ee80ceca40.poster.avif?t=1757014864\" width=630 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/b3fc7513f50eff762a6d50ee80ceca40.webm?t=1757014864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/b3fc7513f50eff762a6d50ee80ceca40.mp4?t=1757014864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gold and other loot on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/f28116f6f65b542c7b41d89657d8f212.poster.avif?t=1757014864\" width=630 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/f28116f6f65b542c7b41d89657d8f212.webm?t=1757014864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/f28116f6f65b542c7b41d89657d8f212.mp4?t=1757014864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop by merchants on your way and buy useful items. 50+ unique items in the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit Blades for Hire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/35ec584bf038127fb61f933b2c4375f2.avif?t=1757014864\" width=630 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/f8ba8d89baa802652771369f01d44548.avif?t=1757014864\" width=630 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some areas may have mercenaries for hire. If you have the gold you can add them to your team to increase your odds! Four mercenaries are available to find in the demo, each with their own unique support abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Pixel Graphics and Modern Pinball Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Paladins brings responsive controls and interactive environments to a classic 16-bit atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/b4f0640fa61257160b96e86d1692bc17.poster.avif?t=1757014864\" width=512 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/b4f0640fa61257160b96e86d1692bc17.webm?t=1757014864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/b4f0640fa61257160b96e86d1692bc17.mp4?t=1757014864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Paladins keeps the retro look with vector physics on the back end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Design is Very Human</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an excellent chiptune soundtrack and handmade pixel art, no Gen AI was used to create assets for this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/3bb32d72256a1beda2e8ac3f30d88cc9.avif?t=1757014864\" width=240 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy the demo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome any reviews or feedback. Wishlist if you'd like to know when the full version releases!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960690?t=1757014864","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/9e6eb5dfa6b4013577c3de2e82b1e83d18380441/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757014864","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/6c119ca29ee4d2c4b1c02fd73bfccf9aa0d734f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757014864","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/6c119ca29ee4d2c4b1c02fd73bfccf9aa0d734f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757014864","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >King Aldric's Paladin Guard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/4e9d6a79d4c3f54702debd78ef60cc80.avif?t=1757014864\" width=630 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the king's new tactician. Organize and deploy the paladin guard to protect important shipments headed north through a dangerous new landscape. In the demo, take control of Roland and his squire Oliver in combat. Equip them and power them up to meet the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Protect Your Convoy on the Perilous Journey North</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/c232765e7904f3851057ff5189b97405.avif?t=1757014864\" width=630 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three available convoys to choose in the demo, each with their own abilities, advantages, and disadvantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Route</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/3a1244c98f55613ecceb9fc50d017190.poster.avif?t=1757014864\" width=520 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/3a1244c98f55613ecceb9fc50d017190.webm?t=1757014864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/3a1244c98f55613ecceb9fc50d017190.mp4?t=1757014864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the world map and decide which branching paths to take. Some may be more challenging and rewarding than others. Some may lead you to new surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes the first stages within the city walls. Depending on the path you take there are 7 stages with 5 miniboss experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Treasure and Merchants Along the Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/b3fc7513f50eff762a6d50ee80ceca40.poster.avif?t=1757014864\" width=630 height=27