nd in the demo, each with their own unique support abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Pixel Graphics and Modern Pinball Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Paladins brings responsive controls and interactive environments to a classic 16-bit atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/b4f0640fa61257160b96e86d1692bc17.poster.avif?t=1757014864\" width=512 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/b4f0640fa61257160b96e86d1692bc17.webm?t=1757014864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/b4f0640fa61257160b96e86d1692bc17.mp4?t=1757014864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Paladins keeps the retro look with vector physics on the back end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Design is Very Human</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an excellent chiptune soundtrack and handmade pixel art, no Gen AI was used to create assets for this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960690/extras/3bb32d72256a1beda2e8ac3f30d88cc9.avif?t=1757014864\" width=240 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy the demo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome any reviews or feedback. Wishlist if you'd like to know when the full version releases!</p>","developers":["Offhand Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3434820","name":"Pinball Paladins"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://